0..69 Comment "//! This source tests recursive calls that remain open at a variable."
70..73 Comment "//!"
74..160 Comment "//! The checker keeps a recursive call in an arm until the checker knows its argument."
161..236 Comment "//! The pathological twin refuses an endpoint that gives this call a value."
